# Keep every mirrored byte exactly as published.
#
# This repository is a byte-exact mirror of canonical FarmDash production truth. Git's
# autocrlf/EOL normalisation would rewrite line endings on checkout, so a consumer would
# receive bytes that differ from the canonical source even though the stored blob matched.
# `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion for every path, so what is committed is
# exactly what is checked out, on every platform and regardless of a consumer's global
# git configuration.
* -text